<title>USA: Hillman group cuts stake in Read-Rite.</title>
<headline>Hillman group cuts stake in Read-Rite.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group including Hillman Co of Pittsburgh, Pa., said Thursday it lowered its stake in Read-Rite Corp to 2,265,497 or 4.85 percent.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said it sold one million shares between March 23 and October 4.</p>
<p>Of the amount, 715,000 common shares were sold on October 4. The aggregate sale price for the common shares was $17,630,750, the filing said.</p>
